    "title": "Present price exactly on buy_top: the Buy interval is closed",
    "description": "The worked-example series with the current price set exactly to the top of the first zone (23.32992). The Buy interval is closed at its top per the normative comparators, so the zone is still Buy; the U/D ratio is exactly 2 by construction (the price sits one third up the range), raising ud_below_target and leaving the U/D criterion Unmet; appreciation drops below 100% so the candidate fact is false.",
